  ⚠ Approve proposal p-0005 and apply these changes to /srv/files-example?      
                                                                                
  Yes marks the proposal as approved and then makes the changes shown, the way  
  adding the folder by hand makes them. Right before that the proposal and its  
  effect are read again, and nothing is applied if either differs from what you 
  saw. The result is kept on the proposal. Containers of these stacks already   
  run, so deploying would create duplicate containers and take their ports      
  twice. qhost only warns.                                                      
                                                                                
